          "id": "PRR_kwDONtWm_c8AAAABC_yRsA",
          "databaseId": 4496069040,
          "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR replaces previously global page-table “axioms” with per-`PageTableConfig` proof lemmas and threads those lemmas through the virtual-address range arithmetic, so key bounds and bit-shift facts are proven from configuration-specific assumptions rather than assumed globally.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `PageTableConfig` proof requirements for top-level index range bounds and the relationship between `LEADING_BITS` and “high-half” sign-extension.\n- Reworked `vaddr_range` helper arithmetic (`pt_va_range_start/end`, `sign_bit_of_va`) to be internally verified, supported by new proofs in `vaddr_range_proofs.rs`.\n- Updated page-table node meta proofs to use the new per-config lemmas instead of the removed global axioms.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 5 out of 5 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `ostd/src/mm/vm_space.rs` | Implements new `PageTableConfig` proof lemmas for `UserPtConfig`. |\r\n| `ostd/src/mm/page_table/node/mod.rs` | Switches proof calls from removed global axioms to new `PageTableConfig` lemmas. |\r\n| `ostd/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs` | Introduces new trait proof requirements and removes global axiom usage in vaddr-range logic by verifying helper arithmetic. |\r\n| `ostd/src/mm/kspace/mod.rs` | Implements new `PageTableConfig` proof lemmas for `KernelPtConfig`. |\r\n| `ostd/specs/mm/page_table/vaddr_range_proofs.rs` | Adds supporting lemmas to justify shifts/multiplication equivalences and wrapping-sub behavior used by `vaddr_range`. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/asterinas/vostd/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
          "bodyHTML": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Pull request overview</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR replaces previously global page-table “axioms” with per-<code class=\"notranslate\">PageTableConfig</code> proof lemmas and threads those lemmas through the virtual-address range arithmetic, so key bounds and bit-shift facts are proven from configuration-specific assumptions rather than assumed globally.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">PageTableConfig</code> proof requirements for top-level index range bounds and the relationship between <code class=\"notranslate\">LEADING_BITS</code> and “high-half” sign-extension.</li>\n<li>Reworked <code class=\"notranslate\">vaddr_range</code> helper arithmetic (<code class=\"notranslate\">pt_va_range_start/end</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">sign_bit_of_va</code>) to be internally verified, supported by new proofs in <code class=\"notranslate\">vaddr_range_proofs.rs</code>.</li>\n<li>Updated page-table node meta proofs to use the new per-config lemmas instead of the removed global axioms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Reviewed changes</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Copilot reviewed 5 out of 5 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">ostd/src/mm/vm_space.rs</code></td>\n<td>Implements new <code class=\"notranslate\">PageTableConfig</code> proof lemmas for <code class=\"notranslate\">UserPtConfig</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">ostd/src/mm/page_table/node/mod.rs</code></td>\n<td>Switches proof calls from removed global axioms to new <code class=\"notranslate\">PageTableConfig</code> lemmas.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">ostd/src/mm/page_table/mod.rs</code></td>\n<td>Introduces new trait proof requirements and removes global axiom usage in vaddr-range logic by verifying helper arithmetic.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">ostd/src/mm/kspace/mod.rs</code></td>\n<td>Implements new <code class=\"notranslate\">PageTableConfig</code> proof lemmas for <code class=\"notranslate\">KernelPtConfig</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"notranslate\">ostd/specs/mm/page_table/vaddr_range_proofs.rs</code></td>\n<td>Adds supporting lemmas to justify shifts/multiplication equivalences and wrapping-sub behavior used by <code class=\"notranslate\">vaddr_range</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">💡 <a href=\"/asterinas/vostd/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\">Learn how to get started</a>.</p>",
